<decisions #fix-conversation-generation-sequence-replay {
  track = "fix-conversation-generation-sequence-replay"
}
(
  <decision #fix-conversation-generation-sequence-replay.canonical-order {
    status = "accepted"
    priority = "P0"
    durable_candidate = true
  }
  (
    <question ?>Conversation generation 应使用哪个字段恢复消息顺序？</?>
    <answer { }
    (
      <raw-answer ?>用户确认按调查方案创建并实施修复 track。</?>
      <decision-text ?>完整 sequence metadata 存在时以 HistoryMessage.sequence 为权威顺序；仅对 sequence 不完整的 legacy generation 使用 committedAt fallback。</?>
      <rationale ?>现有 committedAt 混合 wall-clock milliseconds 与 generation ordinal，而 sequence 在故障 generation 中完整连续。</?>
      <evidence ?>Auto_LIFE.OS incident generation records ::0 through ::408 and production loader comparison.</?>
    )>
  )>
)>

